<title>UK: S&amp;P gives Storebrand A plus claims rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P gives Storebrand A plus claims rating.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it assined Storebrand Skadeforsikring AS an A plus claims paying ability rating.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating reflects Storebrand's dominant and stable position in the Norwegian market, its focused strategy, good operating performance and capitalisation,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;This is offset by Storebrand's dependence on a relatively small market and the potential for increased competition in the short term,&quot; the agency said.</p>
</text>
